h OFF&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1454" y="1594" width="185" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c199" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/analytics/Log_Analytics_Workspaces.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1615" y="1599" width="18" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c200" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Alerts + budget&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;AOAI 429 rate, tokens vs quota,&lt;br&gt;5xx, KV Forbidden&lt;br&gt;budget USD 5,000 / month&lt;br&gt;-&amp;gt; shared action group&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1647" y="1594" width="185" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c201" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/management_governance/Alerts.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1808" y="1599" width="18" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c202" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Locks + RBAC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;CanNotDelete on KV, storage,&lt;br&gt;AOAI&lt;br&gt;Reader group: standing&lt;br&gt;Operators: PIM only&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=4;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1840" y="1594" width="185" height="120" as="geometry"/></m