x&quot;&gt;Nightly drift&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;plan -detailed-exitcode&lt;br&gt;per client, read-only&lt;br&gt;opens a GitHub issue&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=4;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2060" y="1935" width="389" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c318" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Flux (AKS clients)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;reconciles kubernetes/&lt;br&gt;from Git inside the cluster&lt;br&gt;CI needs no access to the&lt;br&gt;private API server&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=26;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2463" y="1935" width="389" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c319" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;points=[];image=img/lib/azure2/containers/Kubernetes_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2828" y="1940" width="18" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c320" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;App releases&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5b6675&quot;&gt;build once, sign, push to&lt;br&gt;ACR; promote the same&lt;br&gt;digest ring by ring&lt;br&gt;via app_image&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c3cad4;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=0;spacingRight=4;fontColor=#1b2430;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2866" y="1935" width="389" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c321" value="Apply identities: 